{
  "title": "Quick Caramel Turkish Eggplant Kebabs",
  "description": "A pungent and crunchy vegetarian Turkish dish featuring caramel and lacquer glaze, perfect for a quick dinner or snack. This recipe combines the sweetness of caramel with the earthiness of eggplant.",
  "cuisine": "Turkish",
